stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> CREATED
  CREATED --> PENDING: bank accepted (Pix, Bolecode)
  CREATED --> AUTHORIZED: card authorized, no capture
  CREATED --> COMPLETED: card captured
  CREATED --> FAILED: refused / declined
  PENDING --> COMPLETED: paid
  PENDING --> EXPIRED: not paid in time
  PENDING --> CANCELED: merchant canceled
  EXPIRED --> COMPLETED: late payment (bank wins)
  AUTHORIZED --> COMPLETED: captured
  AUTHORIZED --> CANCELED: voided
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  CANCELED --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*]
